    "Worker passes raw.case as spec to model_binding/tree and raw.search as result to tree/learning_update. It compares remaining raw scalars/maps directly. It never assigns into raw, any raw descendant, or a list obtained from raw. New result is a separate receipt dictionary.",
    "model_binding reads spec.length/spec.target; reconstructed placements and domains are fresh objects. No spec mutation or element identity check.",
    "tree obtains saved events/hints/weights and visits saved tree children by iteration. Saved node fields/census/event items/features/point/keys/reviews/hints are used only in equality, near, hashing, length, indexing, iteration or scalar decisions. These operations have unchanged values and pair list types.",
    "Active branch hint.item is taken from independently reconstructed proposals, after saved hints/events are compared; it is not an alias to the saved hint.item. Those proposals and independent graph state are fresh containers from the separately loaded unchanged model.",
    "LiteralDomains, initial, advance and cluster read model supports and create/copy independent dictionaries, lists and sets for mutations. Their candidate/model inputs do not use new pair sharing.",
    "LiteralFeatures/features reads spec.target and independent model/state/proposals; its mutation sites concern newly constructed feature dictionaries, sets, counters and lists, not saved trace values.",
    "RNG policy functions and near/packed/sha read saved weights/features/values. learning_update constructs a new gradient, scaled gradient and weight dictionaries; the trace result/transition are not mutated.",
    "Success decoding deep-copies inventory command from the unchanged separately loaded model, not saved trace proof. Assignments inputs/source affect the fresh command dictionary. The saved proof is compared by ordinary equality.",
    "Exact V2 serializer groups field references into a new pending dictionary and C-json encodes them; it neither mutates input values nor observes pair identity. Complete original byte gate is unchanged and occurs before semantic replay.",
